msgstr "Install MesPy, check that it works, and choose where to go next. Everything you need to get started, in just a few steps."

msgid "Apri Google Colab"
msgstr "Open Google Colab"

msgid "Video"
msgstr "Video"

msgid "Guarda l’installazione passo per passo."
msgstr "Watch the installation step by step."

